<h2 id="widget-deep-heading">Prayer times widget: complete embed guide for mosques and websites</h2>
<p><strong>Short answer:</strong> A prayer times widget embeds calculated daily Salah start times on an external website. Choose verified coordinates, a recognised prayer calculation method, an IANA timezone and an Asr convention; then preview the responsive iframe and paste the generated HTML into your site. It is <strong>not</strong> an authoritative mosque congregational (iqamah) schedule.</p>
